# Pairs with NoFalseAbsence. The undecided result of an accepted app
# activation is finalized at once, so an activation that lands after the
# facade returned is recorded as having changed nothing.
MODULE: AuditActivationFinalizedAtReturn
TARGET: NoFalseAbsence
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an accepted, still-running activation is finalized when the facade returns
PERTURBS: Finalize

--- FIND
        outcome == CASE op[o].result \in {"infra", "undecided"} -> "Pending"
--- REPLACE
        outcome == CASE op[o].result = "infra" -> "Pending"
--- END
